@startuml decision_model

hide empty description

state ACTIVE {
  [*] --> INIT
  INIT : mode STOP
  HOLD : stop line on
  ENTRY_GO : stop line off
  COMMITTED : until goal

  INIT -right-> HOLD : [geometry cached]
  HOLD -right-> ENTRY_GO : [all entry checks pass]
  ENTRY_GO -left-> HOLD : [any entry check fails]
  ENTRY_GO -right-> COMMITTED : [front > entry_x]
}

note bottom of ACTIVE
  **Entry checks (all must pass)**
  * Panel shows GO
  * Beacon fresh
  * Camera fresh
  * LiDAR fresh
  * Lane clear
end note

SAFE_STOP : mode STOP
FAULT : mode FAULT

ACTIVE -down-> SAFE_STOP : [scene stale or invalid]
SAFE_STOP -up-> ACTIVE : [scene valid again]
ACTIVE -down-> FAULT : [invalid path]
@enduml
